= A Growing Bubble

The economy continues to expand, but some bankers and economists are growing uneasy. Railroad securities and other speculative ventures are trading well above their actual earnings, fueled by credit that assumes the boom will continue. For now, the money keeps flowing. How long that lasts remains uncertain.